Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.85,0:00:04.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm watching you from over here!\NYou better not stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:06.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Rocket Engine Valve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.11,0:00:08.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:10.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I am Rocket Engine Valve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.65,0:00:15.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:17.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Jiji?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:27.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yo. You're finally here.\NI heard all about it from your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:30.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What? Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:31.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:35.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That guy is Momo's childhood friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:38.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,and her first love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.27,0:00:48.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Ayase's first crush?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.23,0:00:50.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}He looks so cool.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:53.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}From how he's dressed,\Nhe's definitely an athlete.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:56.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}He looks really sincere, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.70,0:01:00.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Ayase falling for him\Nmust mean that he's a proper guy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.25,0:01:07.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo, you're such a cutie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:13.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And your terrible impression...\NSo priceless!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:18.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.09,0:01:19.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wanna hug for starters?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.64,0:01:21.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So annoying. What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.89,0:01:24.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I got me an "annoying"!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:27.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Gimme more!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:29.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, help me kill this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.19,0:01:32.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Jiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.57,0:01:34.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.61,0:01:36.11,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's been a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.36,0:01:38.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're still as beautiful as ever, Auntie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.86,0:01:42.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You've grown up into quite the genius.\NWell, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.74,0:01:44.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait a sec, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.29,0:01:49.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.33,0:01:51.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He's gonna live with us starting today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.17,0:01:56.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.01,0:01:58.84,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:02.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,"Absolutely!" and "Not!"\Nstill means you like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:05.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you a genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:08.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thanks for having me, fam!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:10.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Whoa! What about my permission!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.15,0:02:13.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,L-Live together?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.57,0:02:15.23,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's too unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:18.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is she getting another new demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.45,0:02:22.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Can it be that she's diligently\Ngathering allies
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.99,0:02:26.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,to prepare for the coming of Ragnarok,\Nthe final war?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.62,0:02:28.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't think that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:30.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I won't allow it, Momo Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:32.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:35.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can totally see through your schemes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:38.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're temporary allies\Nagainst the alien threat,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:41.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,but once that's over, you're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:43.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Is she still hooked on that idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:44.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Seems so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:48.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I will gather forces as well\Nto challenge your Ragnarok!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.73,0:02:49.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:52.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thanks for your effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:55.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All these troublesome things\Ncame rushing over at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:03:00.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, I'll head home now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:01.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.53,0:03:05.91,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:07.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.47,0:03:28.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, Okarun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:36.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:42.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:48.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,"See you tomorrow!"\NIt's your turn to say it, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.20,0:03:50.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:52.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're taking turns?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:54.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We are! So just say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:56.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, er...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.59,0:03:58.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.42,0:04:00.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,See you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:01.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:05.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:08.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.50,0:04:34.50,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:35.88,BD Top Right,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,KEEP OUT\NJIJI'S ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:39.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why is Jiji living at our place?\NGive me a proper explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.59,0:04:41.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Auntie's cooking is too good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:45.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you a genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:46.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:48.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I told you already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.97,0:04:52.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Both of Jiji's parents\Nhave been hospitalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.39,0:04:53.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But why our place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.93,0:04:56.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You usually go to a relative's house\Nin times like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:58.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're so cold-hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.77,0:05:01.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Society is about helping each other out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:03.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Auntie, you're so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:07.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on now, Jiji.\NYou really are a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:09.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Make sure to eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.20,0:05:10.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Tank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:13.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He just got you by the heartstrings!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:17.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't be dumb. Nobody's ever gotten me\Nby my heartstrings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.29,0:05:20.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Auntie, you're a serious cutie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:23.17,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Jiji, just how much of a genius are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:24.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Make sure to eat up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:27.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Tank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:29.89,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There's definitely something funny going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:31.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Tank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:33.64,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I meant something is weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:37.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Did we get along that well to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:42.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Back in grade school,\NI made fun of you, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.19,0:05:44.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Looking back now, I seriously regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:46.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.91,0:05:50.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I can see ghosts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.28,0:05:53.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, did you pick up\Na golden ball by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.25,0:05:55.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Golden ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:57.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Did I make a dirty joke at some point?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:06:00.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Forget I said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:04.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I moved away, so we went\Nto different middle schools, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.80,0:06:07.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We moved way out into the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:10.22,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I've always liked places with lots of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:15.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And the new house was big and clean,\Nso I was all hyped up in the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:21.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But gradually, I started feeling\Nlike something was off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.44,0:06:29.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's hard to explain, but the things\Nlying around, the toilet, the bathroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:32.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,They were somehow different\Nthan usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:35.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I told my parents,\Nbut they wouldn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.20,0:06:40.42,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I had to convince myself\Nthat I was imagining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.79,0:06:43.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I lived each day pretending\NI didn't notice anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.92,0:06:48.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But it became so clear\Nand was telling me to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:52.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It went out of its way\Nto show itself before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.85,0:06:59.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And ever since, I see it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.31,0:07:04.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My parents' health started\Ngoing downhill from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:11.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That's why I asked famous\Nspirit mediums for an exorcism.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:16.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And when I did,\Nthree of the five committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:17.12,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,JUNE\NSUNHEIGHTS\NPHOTO FOR RECORDS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:17.62,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,DECEMBER\NVALLEY OF SNAKES\NPHOTO FOR RECORDS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:18.16,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,APRIL\NNORTHERN MOUNTAIN TRACKS\NPHOTO FOR RECORDS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:21.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Veteran spirit mediums couldn't exorcise it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:25.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,And the person they recommended me\Nas my last hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:27.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,was Momo's Auntie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.38,0:07:32.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So that's what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:34.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You should've just told me sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.76,0:07:38.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That old hag didn't even mention\Nyou were coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:42.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,But it was probably the right thing\Nto do to come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.31,0:07:43.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:44.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:46.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, can you stop that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:48.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Sorry for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:52.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All sorts of stuff.\NLike how I made fun of you in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.15,0:07:54.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How I'm roping you\Ninto something this dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:58.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you're gonna apologize,\Ndon't come asking for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:02.46,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's fine. My grandma's really tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.62,0:08:05.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll beat\Nthat evil spirit with one blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:08.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I ain't gonna do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:09.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:14.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Like I said, I can only use my powers\Nwithin Kamigoe City.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:17.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo will take on this request.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.01,0:08:18.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Say what? You didn't tell me this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.93,0:08:22.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hold up!\NDid you just call Auntie "Grandma"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:26.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Someone who couldn't see ghosts\Ncan see them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:30.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe that golden ball\Nhas something to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:35.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you take this request, I'll buy you\Nas many uniforms as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:39.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So go blow down that cursed house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.54,0:10:14.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey there! I transferred schools!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.54,0:10:14.42,BD Center Right,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 11\NFIRST LOVE
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:17.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Bo-Bo-Bo-Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.93,0:10:20.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm Jin Enjoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:22.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Please call me Jiji!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:24.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.68,0:10:26.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He's a hottie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:29.65,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Enjoji's parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:32.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're such a cutie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:36.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,...uh, are both in the hospital now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:39.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, this is terrible. If I don't get\Nyour contact info, it'll kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:45.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's having a hard time,\Nso everyone, please help him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.45,0:10:49.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He'll be sitting next to Ayase.\NYou guys are relatives, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:51.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nope! We're family!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:52.79,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're neither of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:54.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Flashy guys are annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:59.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stabbed! Thank you for that\Ntasty roast from a beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:00.13,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:02.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo, this guy's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:07.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He's a hottie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.39,0:11:11.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm a super hottie!\NPout, pout!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.06,0:11:13.27,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm being drawn ever closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:15.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's because you're too cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:18.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's with him? He's hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.44,0:11:19.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oui!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:20.82,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, so who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.11,0:11:23.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,How to put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:26.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A childhood friend-type\Nfrom grade school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:29.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We're living together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:31.62,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.62,0:11:34.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, stop that!\NYou'll start strange rumors!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:36.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let me explain everything\Nproperly in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.34,0:11:37.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Wait, Momo...\N- No, it's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:39.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Lovey...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:41.09,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,dovey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.97,0:11:45.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo and I are in\Na parentally approved relationship!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.93,0:11:47.01,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Living together?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.01,0:11:47.77,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:49.43,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.43,0:11:53.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo already has Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:57.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,"Jealous" is an "adjective"\Nwhich describes nouns.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.11,0:12:01.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,For instance, you can\N"be jealous of another's happiness."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.74,0:12:01.49,BD Top DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's bugging me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:04.20,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Ayase's first crush...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.49,0:12:06.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does she still like him?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:14.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}He called Miss Ayase "Momo,"\Nand said she was cute.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:17.75,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could their feelings be mutual?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:22.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So "beautiful" and "cool"\Nare adjectives as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:25.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}If Miss Ayase were to start dating him...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:31.18,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}will she stop being so kind to me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.39,0:12:36.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure she'll be interested in\Nhis hobbies and lose interest in the occult.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.81,0:12:39.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't be able to talk about\Nthe occult during recess anymore.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.94,0:12:42.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe I won't be able to hang out\Nwith Miss Ayase anymore.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.01,0:13:05.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm no good.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:12.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop distracting yourself, Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.60,0:13:20.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Physical training is more important\Nright now than such thoughts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.03,0:13:25.32,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.62,0:13:30.83,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What're you doing?\NPracticing a new ultimate move?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.16,0:13:37.71,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, you already ate lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:39.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:40.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:43.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm watching over you\Nso you don't do anything funny again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:45.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Watching over me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:49.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,That incident with Miss Shiratori\Nwasn't my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.18,0:13:52.26,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, did you eat lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.52,0:13:54.02,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.23,0:13:56.39,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If both your hands are tied up...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:58.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll feed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.60,0:13:59.15,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:04.03,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I-Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:05.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:09.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh? You're the guy\Nwho was at Momo's place yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:10.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:17.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What do you want? Weren't you gonna eat\Nwith Miko and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:21.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh? Is Momo-chan jealous?\NSuch a cutie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:23.21,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,As if.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.46,0:14:24.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:26.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Yogurt-flavored Pompy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:30.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:32.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Present for you, woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:43.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is futile.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.69,0:14:47.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't watch Miss Ayase amicably\Ntalk to that guy any longer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.11,0:14:49.95,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll try not to see her anymore.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:55.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,{\i1}That will be the best move for myself,\Nand for Miss Ayase.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.25,0:14:59.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:03.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.76,0:15:12.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.93,0:15:17.56,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Get outta my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.19,0:15:22.94,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Nobody can stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:24.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.73,0:15:26.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's that?\NSeriously wicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.44,0:15:29.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop right there, you half-wit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.28,0:15:30.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo, let's run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.61,0:15:32.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:33.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.66,0:15:35.41,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't say I didn't warn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.17,0:15:46.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun! His ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:47.88,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's golden!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:50.55,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo, hide behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.55,0:15:52.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Jiji, calm down!\N- Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:54.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.93,0:15:58.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You've got some nerves!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:02.35,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.35,0:16:04.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:06.98,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Stop this guy!\N- Momo! Hang onto me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.98,0:16:12.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait, you right there!\NGet away from Miss Ayase!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:28.38,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:30.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I want him to get away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.99,0:17:03.66,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn you! I know you're trying\Nto stop me, but I won't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:05.12,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You make me limp.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:07.42,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Another monster came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:08.25,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:14.68,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- Okarun!\N- Momo-chan! The power lines!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:31.07,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo-chan! Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.57,0:17:33.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:37.28,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Thanks, Okarun! You're a lifesaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:39.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,A monster captured us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.99,0:17:41.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll protect you, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.29,0:17:44.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop that! Okarun is on our side!\NHe was with us earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.87,0:17:46.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way! For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:47.29,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.00,0:17:52.67,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, Okarun, brace yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.67,0:17:53.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Jiji, help us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.02,0:18:09.61,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Give up already, you piece of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.61,0:18:12.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We'll slowly pull him here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:16.57,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way! I'm not gonna give up!\NI don't wanna give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.20,0:18:23.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Ew! Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:27.92,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Merge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.14,0:18:43.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Momo, he's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:45.10,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Okarun, after him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.15,0:18:52.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No good. We lost sight of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:57.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,S-So amazing.\NHe transformed and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.65,0:19:02.24,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What should we do? We don't even\Nknow which way he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:07.00,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.00,0:19:08.37,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.76,0:19:21.05,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, what have you been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:26.97,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,KEEP OUT
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.31,0:19:26.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:32.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it all right to barge in without asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:35.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.20,0:19:40.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.53,0:19:42.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I was so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:46.49,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, how did you know\Nwhere he was headed to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:49.87,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,He looks like he's exhausted?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.71,0:19:55.34,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,When he split apart to escape,\NI managed to grab just his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.34,0:20:00.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I punched it on a hunch, and that\Nwas when I heard him screaming in agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.59,0:20:01.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.63,0:20:03.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Woo! Not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.09,0:20:06.85,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I feel a little sorry for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.52,0:20:12.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It's not like we want to catch and eat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:16.19,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If you'll promise not to run away,\NI'll give you your heart back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.73,0:20:20.53,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,So can you show us your golden nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.53,0:20:22.74,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,It might be one of my friend's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.74,0:20:25.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Miss Ayase, can you\Nplease say it more delicately?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:27.16,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Are dirty jokes that popular nowadays?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.87,0:20:34.08,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Taro? Is that you, Taro?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:36.54,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hana!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:37.63,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Where are you, Hana?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:38.96,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Hana!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.09,0:20:42.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No! Don't come here!\NPlease go back, Taro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.59,0:20:45.30,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,No way! I will never give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.80,0:20:48.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I won't give up on you, Hana!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.60,0:20:52.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What? What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.65,0:21:00.73,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.44,0:21:02.78,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I finally found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:04.36,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:06.99,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Why did you put yourself\Nthrough so much danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:09.45,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Because I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.08,0:21:16.33,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Everything changed after I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:20.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My world used to be grey,\Nbut thanks to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:23.80,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,it became so colorful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.76,0:21:25.97,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.97,0:21:29.51,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Our manufacturer's dates\Nare too far apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.51,0:21:31.31,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,We live in different worlds!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.64,0:21:34.69,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,My duties are all over!\NPlease hurry back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.69,0:21:37.06,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Otherwise you'll turn into\Noversized trash, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.19,0:21:38.40,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:42.44,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,You're the one I fell in love with.\NI won't let go of you no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.57,0:21:43.86,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's run away together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:47.70,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,If I don't do anything right here and now,\NI'll regret it for the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:49.58,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Taro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.59,0:23:29.59,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,UMAs were all said to be nonsense,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.59,0:23:33.60,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,but they are "Unidentified Mysterious Animals"\Nso they are simply "unidentified" biologically!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.60,0:23:34.47,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,What's suddenly gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.47,0:23:35.72,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Woo! You're so passionate, Okarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:37.93,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,Next episode,\N"Let's Go to the Cursed House"!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:37.93,BD Top DX,On-screen Text,0,0,0,,EPISODE 12\NLET'S GO TO THE CURSED HOUSE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.10,0:23:41.90,BD DX,NTP,0,0,0,,- So, what got into you now?\N- In other words, I'll never give up!
